    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/89/Sakura_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230607010901\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sakura Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/89/Sakura_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230607010901\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"697\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sakura Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sakura_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>春风使者</b>\n</p><p>一位穿着巫女服饰的年轻女孩，挥动魔法扇便能召唤春天。作为春风的使者，今天的天气预报也是樱花纷飞。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/91/Sakuraspc_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230607011015\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sakuraspc Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/91/Sakuraspc_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230607011015\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"850\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sakuraspc Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sakuraspc_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820123031\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function co